  message: "Closed in PR #3630 (commit 312a081352). Implementation broader than original WI scope: handles BOTH basename-Jinja (role-style {{ ansible_os_family }}.yml) AND path-prefix-Jinja ({{ tasks_path }}/yumrepos.yml) shapes. Empirical: fedora-infra/ansible has 192 Jinja-unresolved edges, all path-prefix; the fix resolves 191/192 (the remaining 1 has no matching basename in the repo and is genuinely unresolvable). Tagged awaits_bakeoff_validation; expected to lift cohort-3 ansible score (28/35 baseline) by reducing unresolved imports edges that fed the slice/rslice/dataflow gaps."  # 1b69
